   $q$What problem did the coaches notice at their races?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Rowers lacked the fitness to complete a full two-kilometer race.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Rowers started very fast and then slowed down badly near the finish.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Rowers rowed at an even pace that was too slow to win races.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-cause-effect"},{"text":"Rowers started too slowly and could never catch the leading boats.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Rowers started very fast and then slowed down badly near the finish.$q$, $q$The first paragraph says rowers would "burst off the starting line" and "then fade badly in the final stretch." Halvorsen thought the problem was "pacing rather than fitness," so the fitness choice contradicts the text.$q$, 'draft', '1d9751b5-86a6-595d-9244-70f23204d3ab')
