   $q$According to the passage, what had happened to the banner by 2018?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It had been moved from the entrance hall to a storage room.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-time-period"},{"text":"It had been damaged by water leaking from the tall window.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Its gold had faded to tan, and the silk had split in many places.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It had been repainted several times and lost its original design.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Its gold had faded to tan, and the silk had split in many places.$q$, $q$The first paragraph says "the gold had faded to a dull tan, and the silk had split in dozens of places." The window is linked to sunlight damage, not water, and the banner was moved only after the repair.$q$, 'draft', '3f359569-85c4-592a-a1f7-a3538eb0a627')
