   $q$According to the survey, what was the most common reason families threw food away?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The family had bought more food than it could finish in a week.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"The food had gone bad because it was stored in the wrong place.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"They relied on the date printed on the package.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The cans or packages had dents and bulges.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$They relied on the date printed on the package.$q$, $q$The second paragraph states that "the most common reason families gave for throwing food away was the date printed on the package." Dents and bulges appear later only as a tip in the students' guide.$q$, 'draft', '302f1042-d238-54e1-9bc9-79b37baae6d8')
